                "content": "# CHIQUITO CREEK NEAR MUGLER MEADOW, CALIF. (cont.)\n\nDIVERSIONS.-None.\n\nACCURACY.-Stage-discharge relation did not change during the year. Rating curve very well defined. Gage-height record not sufficient for ascertaining daily discharge except during May and June. Monthly discharge for other months estimated from discharge measurements, scattered staff-gage read- ings, and comparison with record of water-stage recorder on Chiquito Creek near Arnold Meadow. Records fair.\n\nCOOPERATION.-Gage-height record and results of discharge measurements fur- nished by Southern California Edison Co., through H. W. Dennis, chief civil engineer.\n\nDischarge measurements of Chiquito Creek near Mugler Meadow, Calif., during the year ending September 30, 1925",
